    "detailed_description": "An open World Space Logistics Simulator.<br>Help humanitys new colonization effort by delivering vital supplies to various outposts and factories around the planet and in space.<br>head deep into dark asteroid fields or skim the surface of vast oceans.<br>The cargo in Planet Prospector is a physical container you must load, attach to the ship and fly around with.<br>its is not a fake magickly in your hold inventory item.<br>Once you reach a selling point you must lower the cargo onto the drop pad to complete the sale.<br>Land Anywhere on the planet and summon a Rover or on foot exploring and finding rare ores to mine and sell.<br><br>The jump system in Planet prospector is not a selected point to jump to system. you must manually input the distances you want to jump. there are HUD elements that help you get your distances, so jump carefully captain!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822110/extras/80296e38d5f792afbc35cfdf50ac66f6.avif?t=1747338639\" width=800 height=258 /></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822110/extras/8d1f2d3ebcac10856933498d2406d55f.avif?t=1747338639\" width=800 height=258 /></span><br><br>Earn credits and buy new ships.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822110/extras/fa75fbd8e1ab92686200fb8e74ce7925.avif?t=1747338639\" width=800 height=258 /></span><br><br>Fly inside huge stations to sell or collect cargo<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822110/extras/42672458cdc99ab6aa0c34961d9b472f.avif?t=1747338639\" width=800 height=258 /></span><br><br>Planet prospector Current Features.<br>. Physical Cargo system.<br>. Cargo Delivery Job System<br>. A few ships to buy each having positive and negative traits. with more to come.<br>. Many POI's to explore<br>. Track IR Support<br>. Partial Controller Support<br>. Mining<br>. Land Vehicle and walking/mining on planet<br><br>Planned Features.<br>. joystick and gamepad support.<br>. Lots more ships to buy.<br>. Capital ship owning.<br>. Combat (most likely last thing to add.)<br><br><br><br>Thank you for reading, As a new Developer I just want to be honest and state what is planned. some of it I may not be able to myself but if the game picks up I'll surely get help.<br><br>There should be an open test soon and be sure to join the discord",
