A few ships to buy each having positive and negative traits. with more to come.<br>. Many POI's to explore<br>. Track IR Support<br>. Partial Controller Support<br>. Mining<br>. Land Vehicle and walking/mining on planet<br><br>Planned Features.<br>. joystick and gamepad support.<br>. Lots more ships to buy.<br>. Capital ship owning.<br>. Combat (most likely last thing to add.)<br><br><br><br>Thank you for reading, As a new Developer I just want to be honest and state what is planned. some of it I may not be able to myself but if the game picks up I'll surely get help.<br><br>There should be an open test soon and be sure to join the discord",
